{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41172","headline":"南隐游泉山 · 孔德绍","name":"南隐游泉山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名山狎招隐，俗外远相求。\n还如倒景望，忽似阆风游。\n临崖俯大壑，披雾仰飞流。\n岁积松方偃，年深椿欲秋。\n野花开石镜，云叶掩山楼。\n何须问方士，此处即瀛洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔德绍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}